docs/portal/31_reviewer_log_v2.html

# The live journal. `*.db` above already matched it; it stayed TRACKED until now
# because untracking changes the backup posture - git stops being a safety net.
# Jay's call, 23-Sep: untrack it. The safety net is the dated backups beside it
# (72 of them, daily since 2 Jun) plus the 16:30 journal_sync against Dhan, which
# is authoritative anyway. Positions and P&L do not belong in a pushed repo.
trade_journal_v6.db

# Delivery history (23-Sep-2026) — cash_bhavcopy.py. Same standing as fno_history:
# reconstructible from NSE's archive by re-running the backfill, ~900k rows, and it
# grows every trading day. data/cash_bhav/ holds the raw daily CSVs and is pruned
# during a backfill anyway.
data/delivery_history.parquet
data/cash_bhav/

# screener.in company pages cached by screener_history.py (paid-session content; data, not code)
data/screener_pages/
